API-17: return node and link type codes as numbers from the property getters

The output file stores a node's or link's type code (property code 0) as an
INT4 and its other properties as REAL4. SMO_getPropertyValue() and
SMO_getPropertyValues() fread every slot into a float, so an outfall's type
code 1 came back as 1.4e-45. Read the type-code slot as an INT4 and convert it
to float; all other properties are read as before.

Apply from the root of a Stormwater-Management-Model checkout at cb3e192b:
    git apply API-17_swmm530.patch

diff --git a/src/legacy/output/swmm_output.c b/src/legacy/output/swmm_output.c
